    "notes": "QWERTY base with the six Esperanto accented letters ĉ ĝ ĥ ĵ ŝ ŭ added. Esperanto has no q, w, x, or y; those keys are repurposed to host the accented letters (q->ŭ, w->ĉ, x->ĝ, y->ĵ, plus ĥ and ŝ on trailing keys). Placement chosen for convenience and noted as such."
